==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From American seismologist [[w:Charles Richter|Charles Richter]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[logarithmic]] [[scale]] used to [[express]] the [[energy]] released by an [[earthquake]], each [[increase]] of 1 representing a 32-fold increase in energy.

